<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Candidate Accepted Invitation</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7f9;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="background-color: #f4f7f9; padding: 40px 15px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="
              max-width: 520px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 12px;
              overflow: hidden;
              border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  background-color: #0f766e;
                  padding: 28px 25px;
                  text-align: center;
                "
              >
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    font-size: 23px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Assessly
                </h1>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #ccfbf1; font-size: 14px">
                  Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 36px 30px">
                <h2
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    color: #111827;
                    font-size: 22px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Invitation Accepted
                </h2>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 14px;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  Hello <strong><%= companyName %></strong>,
                </p>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  Good news! <strong><%= candidateName %></strong> has accepted
                  your assessment invitation on Assessly.
                </p>

                <table
                  role="presentation"
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  style="
                    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                    background-color: #f9fafb;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 16px 18px">
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 6px;
                          color: #6b7280;
                          font-size: 12px;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                        "
                      >
                        Assessment title
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          color: #111827;
                          font-size: 16px;
                          font-weight: 600;
                          line-height: 1.5;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= assessmentTitle %>
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 14px 0 5px;
                          color: #6b7280;
                          font-size: 12px;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                        "
                      >
                        Candidate email
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          color: #374151;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 1.5;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= candidateEmail %>
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 14px 0 5px;
                          color: #6b7280;
                          font-size: 12px;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                        "
                      >
                        Accepted at
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          color: #374151;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 1.5;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= acceptedAt %>
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 22px 0 0;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  You can check the candidate's status in your Assessly
                  dashboard and follow the next steps for the assessment.
                </p>

                <div
                  style="
                    margin-top: 26px;
                    padding: 14px 15px;
                    background-color: #f0fdfa;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                    color: #115e59;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                  "
                >
                  This is an automated notification from Assessly confirming
                  that the candidate accepted the invitation.
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 22px 25px;
                  background-color: #f8fafc;
                  text-align: center;
                  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px">
                  Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px">
                  &copy; <%= year %> Assessly. All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 11px">
                  This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
